@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+The command recorded in kprove-no-entry-bridge.log produced no prover output
+for more than three minutes. The reviewer then sent Ctrl-C to that exact
+exec session. The exec tool returned exit status 130. This is only a bounded
+dependency diagnostic, not a candidate-proof result and not infrastructure
+evidence.
